<%- include('partials/head') %>
<main id="main">
  <section class="pageHero">
    <div class="container visualHero">
      <div class="pageHeroCopy">
        <span class="kicker">FAQ</span>
        <h1>Answers without the wall of text.</h1>
        <p>The main questions about ordering, servers, VPN access, support and policies.</p>
      </div>
      <img class="pageArtwork" src="/images/hero-infrastructure.svg" alt="Illustration of connected VPN4U services">
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container faqList">
      <div class="faqGroup">
        <h2>Ordering & payment</h2>
        <details open><summary>How do I place an order?</summary><p>Choose a plan and submit the order-request form. We review availability and the requested configuration before confirming the next step.</p></details>
        <details><summary>When do I pay?</summary><p>We confirm the requested configuration and availability before payment is requested. The public website does not currently take live payments.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Are the website prices final?</summary><p>Published prices are indicative retail prices in GBP. Taxes, software licences, setup work or non-standard options can change the final amount, which is confirmed before payment.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How fast is provisioning?</summary><p>VPS and VPN services are commonly available within one business day after approval. Dedicated servers are normally within 1–3 business days, subject to stock and configuration.</p></details>
      </div>

      <div class="faqGroup">
        <h2>VPS & dedicated servers</h2>
        <details><summary>Are servers managed?</summary><p>Standard VPS and dedicated products are primarily self-managed infrastructure. You are responsible for the operating system, applications, security updates and backups unless management is explicitly included.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Do I get root or administrator access?</summary><p>VPS and dedicated-server products are intended to provide administrative access to the operating system unless an accepted order says otherwise.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Are backups included?</summary><p>Not unless they are explicitly listed in your accepted order. Customers should maintain independent backups of important data.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Can I request another location or custom hardware?</summary><p>Yes. Send the preferred region and technical requirements to sales. Availability and pricing can vary by location and stock.</p></details>
      </div>

      <div class="faqGroup">
        <h2>VPN</h2>
        <details><summary>Which protocols are supported?</summary><p>Standard VPN plans are designed around established protocols including WireGuard and OpenVPN where supported by the selected service.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How many devices can I use?</summary><p>The device allowance is shown on each VPN plan. Choose the plan that matches the number of devices you intend to connect.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Do you promise complete anonymity?</summary><p>No. A VPN is one privacy and security layer. It does not prevent every form of tracking, make a device immune from malware or make unlawful activity lawful.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Is there a fixed bandwidth cap?</summary><p>Current plans are advertised without a fixed bandwidth cap, subject to available network capacity, reasonable operation and the Acceptable Use Policy.</p></details>
      </div>

      <div class="faqGroup">
        <h2>Support, cancellations & policies</h2>
        <details><summary>How do I contact support?</summary><p>Email <a href="mailto:<%= site.emails.support %>"><%= site.emails.support %></a> and include the order or service reference where possible.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How do I cancel?</summary><p>Contact support before the next renewal or invoice date stated in your order or billing communication. Cancellation normally stops future renewal.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Can I get a refund?</summary><p>Refund eligibility depends on the service, whether provisioning has started, any setup or allocation costs and applicable law. See the Cancellation & Refund Policy for details.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How do I report abuse?</summary><p>Email <a href="mailto:<%= site.emails.abuse %>"><%= site.emails.abuse %></a> with relevant IP addresses or hostnames, timestamps and supporting evidence where available.</p></details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section sectionMuted"><div class="container cta"><div><span class="kicker">Still unsure?</span><h2>Ask us before you order.</h2><p>Send the workload, preferred location and approximate resource requirements. We can help narrow down the right service.</p></div><a class="button" href="/contact">Contact VPN4U</a></div></section>
</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
